# Tab support: 'check ... exists', 'check ... not exists' and 'click' against a live Contacts form.
# Neither command was changed to gain tab support; Tab simply implements IClickable and IExistable.

use Supervisor
open ContactForm for c4ed336c-3e9b-40fe-8b82-5632476472b4

# Every tab the page is expected to show, asserted by code and by caption.
check GeneralInfoTab exists
check TimelineTab exists
check SubscriptionsTab exists
check SalesTab exists
check MarketingTab exists
check ServiceTab exists

# A tab that is configured but must not appear on this page.
check OrdersTab not exists

# Switching between tabs.
click TimelineTab
check TimelineTab exists

click SalesTab
check SalesTab exists

click GeneralInfoTab
check GeneralInfoTab exists

# Fields of the tab we came back to are reachable again.
check Dear exists
check JobTitle exists
